Woodform", "keywords": ["woodpuzzle", "mixedrealitypuzzle", "passthroughpuzzle", "snapfit", "cozypuzzle"], "long_description": "### Turn Your Room Into a Wood Workshop.\n\n**Woodform** is a cozy **Mixed Reality puzzle** that brings tactile woodcraft into your space. A mysterious **pedestal** appears on your table with an unfinished blueprint. Bring it to life \u2014 piece by piece.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83e\udde9 HOW TO PLAY\n\n* **Grab & Move** the pedestal to place the puzzle anywhere\n* **Pick up** wooden blocks and **rotate & align** for a perfect fit\n* **Snap to Fit** \u2014 snapped pieces attach and move with the pedestal\n* **Lift out** any placed piece to try again\n* Complete every joint to unlock the next blueprint\n\n---\n\n### \u2728 FEATURES\n\n* **True Mixed Reality with Passthrough**\nYour table is the workbench. Solve at room scale.\n\n* **Tactile Snap-Fit Puzzle**\nIntuitive grab, rotate and snap. Feel the *satisfaction* when wood clicks.\n\n* **Moveable Pedestal System**\nMove and rotate the pedestal \u2014 all snapped pieces follow.\n\n* **Relaxing & Brain-Teasing**\nDozens of handcrafted blueprints, from simple joints to complex structures.\n\n---\n\n> *No timers. No pressure. Just you, the wood, and the perfect fit.*\n\n**Made for Meta Quest 3 / 3S with Passthrough.**", "short_description": "Assemble wooden pieces in your room. Snap, rotate and fit every block onto the pedestal to complete the blueprint in MR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/seivr/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jone Sei", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/seivr/games", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": 